message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "LLM API pricing dataset"
abstract: >-
  Prices of current large language model APIs as published by their makers,
  with the day each price was last verified and the source page, plus a
  record of every change to those prices. Mirror of https://aisignalhq.com/data/.
